g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:14:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:14:58Z","body":"@Calinou only on Compatibility (both with metal and vulkan). Mobile and F+ tested with both renderers, FPSes are in reasonable range 90-110.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880813252/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880841350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106379#issuecomment-2880841350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106379","id":2880841350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtiaG","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:24:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:24:52Z","body":"> only on Compatibility (both with metal and vulkan). \n\nFor future reference, Compatibility always uses OpenGL, so it doesn't matter which one you select in the Project Settings for the Rendering Device driver. (Compatibility doesn't use RenderingDevice.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880841350/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881390035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106379#issuecomment-2881390035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106379","id":2881390035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rvoXT","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T19:53:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T19:53:03Z","body":"Can repro – over 7,000 fps 😏 \n\nI think (temporarily) I will use `CADisplayLink` to drive the loop when V-SYNC is on. \n\nUltimately, I will look at switching the Rendering Device to also use `IOSurface` or shared Metal textures, so that I can composite the frame within the editor (which will open up single-window mode). I will also introduce UNIX domain sockets, as their latency is about 3x lower than TCP per my tests, as I will need to synchronise frame updates via IPC.\n\n**macOS IPC (Mach ports, UDS and TCP), 64-byte messages, 100000 iterations**\n\n```\nMach IPC latency: 4.13 µs\nMach IPC throughput: 15.48 MB/s\n\nUDS latency: 4.15 µs\nUDS throughput: 15.42 MB/s\n\nTCP latency: 14.74 µs\nTCP throughput: 4.34 MB/s\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881390035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892522127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106379#issuecomment-2892522127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106379","id":2892522127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6saGKP","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","